260
00:11:39,810 --> 00:11:40,970
The most common motor

261
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:42,610
manifestation
is automatisms.

262
00:11:44,650 --> 00:11:47,510
So I put this slide up
here to realize that

263
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:50,390
truly how a person
presents with their

264
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:53,910
