328
00:14:45,910 --> 00:14:48,150
to get control over
their masseter and

329
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:51,550
other jaw muscles please
remember your abcs

330
00:14:51,550 --> 00:14:53,690
make sure the patient's
airway is patent

331
00:14:53,690 --> 00:14:57,390
in the postictal
phase because, like I

332
00:14:57,390 --> 00:14:59,290
said, they're starting
to regain control of

333
00:14:59,290 --> 00:15:01,070
these muscles, and
they might not have a

334
00:15:01,070 --> 00:15:04,010
