340
00:15:18,490 --> 00:15:22,650
so this concept status
epilepticus is a

341
00:15:22,650 --> 00:15:25,210
board's favorite it's
very clinically relevant

342
00:15:25,210 --> 00:15:27,610
which is why we're
talking about it status

343
00:15:27,610 --> 00:15:30,410
epilepticus is a
neurological emergency

344
00:15:30,410 --> 00:15:33,350
that requires immediate
intervention and the

345
00:15:33,350 --> 00:15:35,250
goal of the therapy
is to stop seizure

346
00:15:35,250 --> 00:15:38,670
