394
00:17:55,170 --> 00:17:58,270
and you are very
likely to be tested on

395
00:17:58,270 --> 00:18:00,570
this both for your comp
and on your boards.

396
00:18:02,170 --> 00:18:04,390
And another thing I'd
like to mention is

397
00:18:04,390 --> 00:18:06,870
that hyperventilation,
it can actually

398
00:18:06,870 --> 00:18:09,890
